# .clauderc_scratchpad_contents — scratchpad file manifest, names + locations only
#
# Purpose: quick lookup of what exists in the persistent scratchpad, without
# re-`find`-ing it every session. Names and locations ONLY — for what a
# directory's work was actually about, see that directory's own README.md
# (the point of the README convention, per scratchpad/README.md), or the
# scratchpad's own "## Index" section for the (partial) curated summaries.
#
# Canonical root: ContextPlease/claude/scratchpad/ (versioned, pushed).
# Staging root (pre-mirror, not versioned): ThePlace/.claude/scratchpad/ —
# always mirror new work from there into the canonical root before it's
# considered archived; this manifest reflects the canonical root only.
#
# Maintain this file going forward: regenerate the listing below whenever
# scratchpad content changes, same as any other .clauderc* file, and keep it
# included in every ContextPlease protocol sync pass.
#
# Regenerate with:
#   cd ContextPlease/claude/scratchpad && find . -type f \
#     -not -path "*/__pycache__/*" -not -name "*.pyc" | sort
#
